  "correction_rules": [
    "Adjust forecasts downward when sentiment is low (0.00) and historical prices show downward momentum.",
    "Increase forecast bias toward higher prices when sentiment is positive (≥0.33) and recent prices are trending upward.",
    "Correct for lagged overshoots: if model spikes after a recent high, reduce forecast by 5-10% to avoid overcorrection.",
    "Apply mean reversion for 3-5 day horizons: if forecast deviates >10% from 14-day moving average, revert toward it.",
    "For 30-day forecasts, penalize over-optimism in bullish sentiment: reduce forecast by 2-5% if sentiment >0.50 and price is rising.",
    "When sentiment is neutral (0.00) and true price is rising, add a 3-5% upward bias to avoid underestimating momentum."
